- Klatschify — run with the source article selected. Saves a Klatsch draft in a new tab.
- Description is taken from the source page; no AI service or subscription is used.
* capture the page details as "Klatsch"
* open "https://theklatsch.com/create" in a new tab
* wait until the "Enter article title" textbox
* enter your "Klatsch title" into the "Enter article title" textbox
* enter your "Klatsch description" into the "Write a short description of your article" textbox
* enter "AC and Comet" into the "Author" textbox
* enter your "Klatsch image" into the "Article Image or Video" textbox
* enter your "Klatsch url" into the "Source URL" textbox
* enter "" into the "Write additional content using Markdown..." textbox
* enter "" into the "Add a brief summary..." textbox
* turn off the "Private" checkbox
* turn on the "Draft" checkbox
* if your "Klatsch description" equals ""
** you enter a short Description for this article, then click Continue
* end if
* click the "Save" button
* wait until the "Edit" button
